OL,3,AMother expected to plead guilty over
OL,4,Achild deaths
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother is expected to plead guilty to
OL,7,Fkilling her three young children, a
OL,8,Fcourt has heard.
OL,10,FSeven-year-old Fares Bash,
OL,11,Fthree-year-old Joury Bash and
OL,12,Fnine-month-old Mohammed Bash died at
OL,13,Ftheir home in Sea Mills, Bristol, on 18
OL,14,FFebruary 2024.
OL,16,FYasmeen Ali, 44, is expected to plead
OL,17,Fguilty to their manslaughter by reason
OL,18,Fof diminished responsibility, and the
OL,19,Finfanticide of her nine-month-old son.
