OL,5,
OL,6,FAn inquest previously heard that the
OL,7,Fthree children died of knife wounds,
OL,8,Fwith injuries to their chests and
OL,9,Fnecks. Fares Bash also showed possible
OL,10,Fsigns of asphyxia.
